      "title": "Consensus EPS estimates fall by 13%",
      "body": "The consensus outlook for earnings per share (EPS) in fiscal year 2027 has deteriorated. 2027 revenue forecast decreased from ₹174.3b to ₹170.2b. EPS estimate also fell from ₹27.93 per share to ₹24.36 per share. Net income forecast to grow 113% next year vs 19% growth forecast for Construction industry in India. Consensus price target down from ₹1,404 to ₹1,344. Share price was steady at ₹1,274 over the past week.",
